{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/ctap2\/extension\/hmacsecret"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HmacSecret"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This extension allows a relying party to derive symmetric keys from a credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using HMAC-SHA-256 with user-provided salts. The derived keys can be used for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encryption or other cryptographic operations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"MakeCredential Usage","anchor":"MakeCredential-Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Request hmac-secret support when creating a credential:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret()","let ext = hmacSecret.makeCredential.input()","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ hmac-secret is enabled","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Or derive secrets at registration time (CTAP 2.2 hmac-secret-mc):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret(session: session)","let ext = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.input(salt1: salt, salt2: salt2)","let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.makeCredential(params)","if let result = try hmacSecret.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    switch result {","    case .enabled:","        \/\/ hmac-secret-mc not supported, but hmac-secret is enabled","    case .secrets(let secrets):","        \/\/ Use derived keys (secrets.first, secrets.second)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"GetAssertion Usage","anchor":"GetAssertion-Usage","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Derive keys during authentication:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let hmacSecret = try await CTAP2.Extension.HmacSecret(session: session)","let ext = try hmacSecret.getAssertion.input(salt1: salt)","let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.getAssertion(params)","if let secrets = try hmacSecret.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ Use derived keys (secrets.first, secrets.second)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/fidoalliance.org\/specs\/fido-v2.2-ps-20250714\/fido-client-to-authenticator-protocol-v2.2-ps-20250714.html#sctn-hmac-secret-extension","type":"reference"}]}]},{"style":"note","name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/fidoalliance.org\/specs\/fido-v2.2-ps-20250714\/fido-client-to-authenticator-protocol-v2.2-ps-20250714.html#sctn-hmac-secret-make-cred-extension"}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Extension\/HmacSecret","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentati